<title>LATVIA: ICI INVEST, VENTSPILS BECOME BOURSE MEMBERS.</title>
<headline>ICI INVEST, VENTSPILS BECOME BOURSE MEMBERS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI Invest and Ventspils Apvienota Baltijas Banka (Ventspils United Baltic Bank) have become members of the stock exchange, the bourse said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that bourse members now numbered 28 with paid-up capital of 612,500 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
